# SQLDelight schema snapshots are SQLite database files. Git detects them as
# binary today, but with core.autocrlf=true on Windows that detection is the
# only thing standing between a checkout and a silently corrupted snapshot —
# which would turn the migration verifier into a source of false failures.
*.db binary
# Retraction: an initial eol=lf rule normalized the pinned upstream CRLF bytes.
# Disable conversion so both the Git blob and checkouts retain the source hash.
